    >
    <ITEM
      POSITION 46.5
      SNAPOFFS 0
      LENGTH 11
      LOOP 1
      ALLTAKES 0
      FADEIN 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      FADEOUT 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      MUTE 0 0
      SEL 0
      IGUID {4E5B573A-74F8-4DFD-AFC1-D2424CC57E10}
      IID 36200
      <NOTES
        |Is she to be buried in Christian burial that wilfully seeks her own salvation?
      >
      IMGRESOURCEFLAGS 11
    >
    <ITEM
      POSITION 61.5
      SNAPOFFS 0
      LENGTH 11
      LOOP 1
      ALLTAKES 0
      FADEIN 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      FADEOUT 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      MUTE 0 0
      SEL 0
      IGUID {D9D43E27-5034-40DE-BC78-3A249D362E79}
      IID 36203
      <NOTES
        |I tell thee she is; and therefore make her grave straight: the crowner hath sat on her and finds it Christian burial.
      >
      IMGRESOURCEFLAGS 11
    >
    <ITEM
      POSITION 76.5
      SNAPOFFS 0
      LENGTH 11
      LOOP 1
      ALLTAKES 0
      FADEIN 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      FADEOUT 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      MUTE 0 0
      SEL 0
      IGUID {40B03BA6-918A-4A4D-B209-B7C193121EAE}
      IID 36206
      <NOTES
        |How can that be unless she drowned herself in her own defence?
      >
      IMGRESOURCEFLAGS 11
    >
    <ITEM
      POSITION 91.5
      SNAPOFFS 0
      LENGTH 11
      LOOP 1
      ALLTAKES 0
      FADEIN 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      FADEOUT 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      MUTE 0 0
      SEL 0
      IGUID {09884309-C572-46FF-B62B-5A222262D042}
      IID 36209
      <NOTES
        |Why 'tis found so.
      >
      IMGRESOURCEFLAGS 11
    >
    <ITEM
      POSITION 106.5
      SNAPOFFS 0
      LENGTH 11
      LOOP 1
      ALLTAKES 0
      FADEIN 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      FADEOUT 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      MUTE 0 0
      SEL 0
      IGUID {CEC30404-7F39-4222-ABF7-9DB2B971D0EF}
      IID 36212
      <NOTES
        |It must be se offendendo; it cannot be else. For here lies the point: if I drown myself wittingly it argues an act: and an act hath three branches--it is to act to do to perform: argal she drowned herself wittingly.
      >
      IMGRESOURCEFLAGS 11
    >
    <ITEM
      POSITION 121.5
      SNAPOFFS 0
      LENGTH 11
      LOOP 1
      ALLTAKES 0
      FADEIN 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      FADEOUT 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      MUTE 0 0
      SEL 0
      IGUID {76290E7C-6B18-4534-8707-19360617B180}
      IID 36215
      <NOTES
        |Nay but hear you Goodman Delver--
      >
      IMGRESOURCEFLAGS 11
    >
    <ITEM
      POSITION 136.5
      SNAPOFFS 0
      LENGTH 11
      LOOP 1
      ALLTAKES 0
      FADEIN 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      FADEOUT 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      MUTE 0 0
      SEL 0
      IGUID {24A6DD72-4A1F-4644-983A-B01F94FE46B9}
      IID 36218
      <NOTES
        |Give me leave. Here lies the water; good: here stands the man; good: if the man go to this water and drown himself
      >
      IMGRESOURCEFLAGS 11
    >
    <ITEM
      POSITION 151.5
      SNAPOFFS 0
      LENGTH 11
      LOOP 1
      ALLTAKES 0
      FADEIN 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      FADEOUT 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      MUTE 0 0
      SEL 0
      IGUID {E951C2D7-5D03-4F8D-9F47-2339DCEB257D}
      IID 36221
      <NOTES
        |But is this law?
      >
      IMGRESOURCEFLAGS 11
    >
    <ITEM
      POSITION 166.5
      SNAPOFFS 0
      LENGTH 11
      LOOP 1
      ALLTAKES 0
      FADEIN 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      FADEOUT 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      MUTE 0 0
      SEL 0
      IGUID {334BDB45-D69A-4F60-88E9-8C0156C80ED1}
      IID 36224
      <NOTES
        |Ay marry is't--crowner's quest law.
      >
      IMGRESOURCEFLAGS 11
    >
    <ITEM
      POSITION 181.5
      SNAPOFFS 0
      LENGTH 11
      LOOP 1
      ALLTAKES 0
      FADEIN 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      FADEOUT 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      MUTE 0 0
      SEL 0
      IGUID {E4720BC3-3DF4-436D-BF6B-45E04AD38BA1}
      IID 36227
      <NOTES
        |Will you ha' the truth on't? If this had not been a gentlewoman she should have been buried out o' Christian burial.
      >
      IMGRESOURCEFLAGS 11
    >
    <ITEM
      POSITION 196.5
      SNAPOFFS 0
      LENGTH 11
      LOOP 1
      ALLTAKES 0
      FADEIN 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      FADEOUT 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
      MUTE 0 0
      SEL 0
      IGUID {6C077637-9DFE-4297-B8FF-127EBA2DDF0C}
      IID 36230
      <NOTES
        |Why there thou say'st: and the more pity that great folk should have countenance in this world to drown or hang themselves more than their even Christian. Come
      >
      IMGRESOURCEFLAGS 11
    >
    <ITEM
      POSITION 211.5
